flowchart TD
 A[Customer checkout] --> B[sp_process_sale]
 B --> C{Valid customer, product and quantity?}
 C -- No --> X[Raise error; statement rolls back]
 C -- Yes --> D[Lock inventory row FOR UPDATE]
 D --> E{Available stock sufficient?}
 E -- No --> X
 E -- Yes --> F[Insert order and order item]
 F --> G[Deduct inventory]
 G --> H[AFTER UPDATE trigger]
 H --> I[Write inventory movement]
 H --> J{Stock <= reorder level?}
 J -- Yes --> K[Upsert one OPEN low-stock alert]
 J -- No --> L[Resolve existing alert]
 M[Daily / monthly scheduler] --> N[Snapshot inventory / archive old orders]
 N --> O[Write automation_log]
